# Wave W17-AD (Amber Sea — East): resort sand — bright warm harbour sand, shell-flecked: the fleet’s brightest shore sand, bleached warm by the resort shore sun and flecked with shell white and sparse shell pink (design: Reefside’s rock spikes standing in pink shell sand, Calamondin’s pools glinting off the lane). East’s own sand — split from its twin North by light entire (the brightest water in the program vs the deep channel’s darkest sand) and from Borea’s solar sand (R222) by company: this sand is harbour-kept and shell-strewn, that one is beach-road shore.
